<title>USA: Omaha Power, Neb., won by Lehman at 4.26 pct TIC.</title>
<headline>Omaha Power, Neb., won by Lehman at 4.26 pct TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Thursday it won $80 million Omaha Public Power District, Neb., electric system revenue bonds at a true interest cost of 4.26 percent.</p>
</text>
